# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Local env files. The stock Vite ignore only covers *.local, which leaves a
# plain `.env` tracked -- and that's the file the API base URL goes in.
# .env.example is the committed template and is deliberately un-ignored.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

